WEBVTT
NOTE Cedwyn film, frame 009, en. Timings estimated from the script.

1
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.231
<v Gwen>She's weakening, John. Her hands are cold, for all the fire.

2
00:00:12.581 --> 00:00:21.812
<v Amy Williams>John, bach… don't let the fire go out. Not over Christmas. The fields are in your hands now, as they were in your father's.

3
00:00:26.162 --> 00:00:30.777
<v John Williams>She's gone, Gwen. Sixty-five, she was. She kept this kitchen, every winter.

4
00:00:31.127 --> 00:00:40.742
<v Gwen>I'll write to the Cardiff Times. 'Relict of the late Mr. John Williams, Great House farm.' That's how it should stand in the paper, John.

5
00:00:41.092 --> 00:00:45.323
<v John Williams>Thank you, Gwen. I'll go to the vicar first thing tomorrow.
